     `noindex` — that asks Search Console to log an error against the site on
     every crawl. An empty /blog/ shipped exactly that way and was removed
     rather than padded; tools/check/site-check.mjs now fails on the pairing.

     lastmod is the one field here Google actually reads — changefreq and
